      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Opera House, Harbour Bridge and CBD are simultaneously clear; authored aerial view has no foreground obstruction. Water shows regular broad ripple bands and a bright solar reflection."
    },
    {
      "source": "02_harbour_hero-0075.jpg",
