      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Camera moves closer while retaining both landmarks; the sun reflection is bright but does not erase their silhouettes. Simplified distant facades remain visible."
    },
    {
      "source": "02_harbour_hero-0149.jpg",
      "sha256": "abb56a60cad58329a47aae20017bdd2914523a27f0e06e4f8ed5c4d00fbed3a8",
      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Bridge span and Opera roof groups remain recognizable and unblocked; no newly exposed floating road or missing foreground land is visible in this frame."
    },
    {
      "source": "03_street_drive-0000.jpg",
      "sha256": "9c4f165b99fb97a3e9004e2da3c4434fa6847343795cc1f09f2df87aae57d790",
      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Green car is completely visible between street trees, with continuous paving and road ahead; coarse tree crowns and repeated ordinary facades show the current stylized scope."
    },
    {
      "source": "03_street_drive-0090.jpg",
      "sha256": "56e43bf5bc2c055c1e091e2cd347f81a85a4b5b610baf3843eadaf6cb032b923",
      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Car remains unobscured at centre despite large upper tree crowns. Road and adjacent walking surface are continuous in the sampled frame."
    },
    {
      "source": "03_street_drive-0179.jpg",
      "sha256": "68edfb62dd1c2ee0bdd6be8f2f38bb5717ef457edd885ddc33ccb820c161ca1a",
      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Car remains visible but has left the road and approaches the left facade/grass verge; the near wall occupies much of the frame. This is a weaker closing composition, not proof of a wall penetration."
    },
    {
      "source": "05_opera_steps-0000.jpg",
      "sha256": "ad9bf58b851ea9acbb8933fe17fe641735d7e9544ee0c90b95f8c69f75f73a68",
      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Player stands on visible stepped geometry. Broad monumental stairs and roof supports are visible; no transverse open stair-to-platform gap is visible."
    },
    {
      "source": "05_opera_steps-0075.jpg",
      "sha256": "75b4ffb62a5571c95621bb6522eec653f7355fd3a5c5fd00bd7f021b32385b4c",
      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Player is higher on the same flight; tread surfaces reach the upper landing continuously in the visible area. Facade and roof detailing remain stylized."
    },
    {
      "source": "05_opera_steps-0149.jpg",
      "sha256": "f3ac6c21702cc8ce213146f7cb2d756c904882126d51feb25cdfbea33163309d",
      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Player reaches the upper platform. Visible top treads meet the platform without the old long open gap; this sampled frame does not replace full damaged-stair traversal tests."
    },
    {
      "source": "06_public_interior-0000.jpg",
      "sha256": "a47c64bbb1299f8298c8d64719c7262531b03663623481a2c1507fea7650dfe4",
      "accepted": true,
      "review": "Concert Hall seats, organ, pink reflectors and curved timber ceiling are all visible. No external white shell or bronze louvre wall cuts across the auditorium."
    },
    {
      "source": "06_public_interior-0075.jpg",
      "sha256": "603e2e4266431c777188c729b12c28c41656502c7b0419ba322ed4e4ce61ea95",
